<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech books 440 mln ATS S.Africa order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech books 440 mln ATS S.Africa order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>VAI, a subsidiary of Austrian engineering group VA Technologie, said on Wednesday it had booked an order worth 440 million schillings to modernise South African steel group Iscor's plant in the eastern city of Newcastle.</p>
<p>The order included the revamping of two continuous casting machines and a ladle furnace as well as the supply of a new furnace and a range of other metallurgical facilities for the steel works, VAI said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
